msgstr "Obtenir de l'aide {#get-support}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AI-QEM support team is here to help. If you encounter any issues, have questions about using the AI-QEM Function, or need help troubleshooting a job, contact the support team.\n"
msgstr "L'équipe de support AI-QEM est là pour t'aider. Si tu rencontres des problèmes, as des questions sur l'utilisation de la fonction AI-QEM ou as besoin d'aide pour diagnostiquer un job, contacte l'équipe de support.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support: quantumfunction.support@ltm.com\n"
msgstr "Support : quantumfunction.support@ltm.com\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To help the support team investigate and resolve your issue as quickly as possible, include the following information in your support request:\n"
msgstr "Pour aider l'équipe de support à examiner et résoudre ton problème le plus rapidement possible, inclus les informations suivantes dans ta demande de support :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function job ID (for example, `job.job_id`)\n"
msgstr "L'identifiant du job de la fonction (par exemple, `job.job_id`)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A detailed description of the issue\n"
msgstr "Une description détaillée du problème\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Any relevant error messages, stack traces, or error codes\n"
msgstr "Les messages d'erreur, traces de pile ou codes d'erreur pertinents\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expected behavior and actual behavior (if applicable)\n"
msgstr "Le comportement attendu et le comportement réel (le cas échéant)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete information helps the support team diagnose issues more efficiently and resolve them faster.\n"
msgstr "Des informations complètes aident l'équipe de support à diagnostiquer les problèmes plus efficacement et à les résoudre plus vite.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AI-QEM support team also welcomes feedback and feature requests. If you have suggestions for improvements or capabilities that you want to see in future releases, send them to quantumfunction.support@ltm.com.\n"
msgstr "L'équipe de support AI-QEM accueille aussi volontiers les retours et les demandes de fonctionnalités. Si tu as des suggestions d'amélioration ou des capacités que tu aimerais voir dans les prochaines versions, envoie-les à quantumfunction.support@ltm.com.\n"

